Repository-specific solvers modify and extend the official demo/protocol
lineage with deterministic proof search, finite countermodel catalogs,
paramodulation, Marathon adapters, and bounded model-assisted controllers.
Modified files retain applicable upstream notices.

This product also uses or derives public mathematical data and operation
tables from the Equational Theories Project:

  https://github.com/teorth/equational_theories
  Copyright 2025 Contributors of the Equational Theories Project
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The four published solver files retain the catalog's upstream notice and
pinned source revision. The paper describes the extraction boundary and
aggregate catalog counts. Operational generation records remain in the
private evidence repository.

Lean and Mathlib are external dependencies and are not vendored here. Their
respective upstream licenses apply.
